0,000 with little cash remaining. No outside groups are opposing either candidate, and an independent contender was removed from the ballot.\n\nExpert raters uniformly place the race at Likely Democratic or better, and prediction markets price Pou's chances around 95 percent. With no public polling available, the forecast rests on fundamentals, which favor the incumbent by a double-digit margin. Pou's flood-protection and aviation-safety work gives her moderate-friendly material to run on.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.969, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9625, "margin": 12.5}]}